From df7377ce5303d3679d41acb699c216d1e1645f72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kostersitz <mkostersitz@mac.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:28:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enable enable_refactor_task_thumbnail for the bp2a release
 config (r4 port)

android-16.0.0_r4 (BP4A) TaskView creates RecentsDependencies unconditionally,
and RecentsView only initialises them when enable_refactor_task_thumbnail is on.
That flag is ENABLED in bp3a/bp4a but not in bp2a, which this build still uses,
so the first swipe-up into Overview crashes Launcher3 with
"Recents dependencies are not initialized".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../enable_refactor_task_thumbnail.textproto                | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 release/aconfig/bp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_refactor_task_thumbnail.textproto

diff --git a/release/aconfig/bp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_refactor_task_thumbnail.textproto b/release/aconfig/bp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_refactor_task_thumbnail.textproto
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5adcfb6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/release/aconfig/bp2a/com.android.launcher3/enable_refactor_task_thumbnail.textproto
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+flag_value {
+  package: "com.android.launcher3"
+  name: "enable_refactor_task_thumbnail"
+  state: ENABLED
+  permission: READ_ONLY
+}
-- 
2.43.0

